**To Be a Christian** is a clear and faithful summary of historic Christian belief written from an Anglican perspective and published by the Anglican Church in North America. Structured in a question-and-answer format, it guides readers through the core foundations of the faith.

Rooted in Scripture and shaped by the worship and theology of the Book of Common Prayer, it is designed not only to teach doctrine but to form disciples—helping believers grow in understanding, prayer, and lifelong obedience to Christ within the life of His Church.
